notes:        Actual RTX 4070 Ti/Vulkan and CPU renders of tests::pattern seed 7 (70x44), quantized to 8 bpc, Dust & Scratches radius 3 and threshold 10. Before is upstream 3af4649; after uses CPU-rounded median levels. Premultiplied pixels are displayed over a generated checkerboard with nearest-neighbour magnification; yellow boxes mark pixel (51, 38). Labels use the repository's OFL-licensed Inter font. No third-party media.
